        {
          "en": "This helps children to work out how words are spelt from their sounds.",
          "zh": "这个帮助孩子们到工作出如何单词是 spelt 从他们的声音。",
          "startMs": 50901,
          "endMs": 59417
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose a word from the story that can be spelt out by listening to each sound: 'in', 'cold\", 'sat\", 'rug', 'help', 'ran\", 'van', 'not\", \"that', 'at.",
          "zh": "• 选择一个单词从这故事那个能是 spelt 出由听到每个声音： '在……里'， '冷的， '坐， '小地毯'， '帮助'， '跑， '送货车'， '不， 那个'， '在。",
          "startMs": 59417,
          "endMs": 77665
        },
        {
          "en": "• Ask the child to spell it, and to then find it in the book to check.",
          "zh": "• 问这孩子到咒语它， 和到然后找到它在……里这书到查明。",
          "startMs": 77665,
          "endMs": 86180
        },
        {
          "en": "Take turns to choose and spell a word.",
          "zh": "拿转动到选择和咒语一个单词。",
          "startMs": 86180,
          "endMs": 90803
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 90803,
          "endMs": 97737
        },
        {
          "en": "• Read all the names of ice creams on page 16.",
          "zh": "• 读全部这名字的冰奶油在……上页 16。",
          "startMs": 97737,
          "endMs": 103333
        },
        {
          "en": "How many names of ice creams and lollies can you remember?\"",
          "zh": "如何许多名字的冰奶油和棒棒糖能你记得？",
          "startMs": 103333,
